The files abogus.go, bd_ticket.go, params.go and sm3.go derive from
yunsur/douyin-mcp commit 7e90d139007f141cb7389aa509d8e6e67f7b5840,
under the MIT license in LICENSE.yunsur.

Changes: package adapted for the helper; the signer receives its fingerprint,
clock and random source explicitly instead of reading a global profile or
environment; unknown signing hosts are rejected; ticket signing requires an
explicit mode and timestamp; P-256 private scalars are padded before ECDH and
trailing material after PEM keys is rejected. The code is not a claim that any real account or
platform request has been verified.

The helper uses the Go standard library. The Go distribution license is
included as LICENSE.golang.txt.
